{"id":"word:hebrew:H5262","type":"word","title":"נֶסֶךְ","subtitle":"H5262 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"a libation ; also a cast idol","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to נֶסֶךְ (H5262) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 64 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"נֶסֶךְ (neçek) means a libation ; also a cast idol First listed occurrence: 1Chr 29 21."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"נֶסֶךְ","transliteration":"neçek","pronunciation":"neh'-sek","strong":"H5262","lemmaId":"hebrew:H5262","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["וְ/נִסְכָּֽ/הּ","וְ/נִסְכֵּי/הֶ֡ם","וְ/נִסְכֵּי/הֶֽם","וְ/נִסְכּֽ/וֹ","וְ/נִסְכֵּי/הֶ֔ם"],"morphs":[["HC/Ncmpc/Sp3mp",16],["HNcmpa",8],["HC/Ncmsc/Sp3fs",7],["HC/Ncmsc/Sp3ms",6],["HC/Ncmsa",5],["HNcmsc/Sp3ms",4],["HNcmpc/Sp3mp",3],["HRd/Ncmsa",3],["HNcmsa",2],["HC/Rd/Ncmpa",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"a libation ; also a cast idol","usage":"cover, drink offering, molten image.","full":"H5262. necek נֶ֫סֶךְ noun masculine drink-offering ; — absolute ׳נ Gen 35:14 6 t.; נֵ֫סֶךְ Exod 29:40 ; 30:9 ; Ezek 45:17 ; נָ֑סֶךְ Num 4:7 ; Joel 1:13 ; construct נֶסֶךְ Num 28:7 ; suffix נִסְכִּי Isa 48:5 , etc.; plural נְסָכִים Jer 7:18 9 t.; suffix נְסָכֶיהָ Num 29:31 , נִסְכֵּיכֶם 29:39 , etc.; &#8212; 1 drink-offering , with עַל (on Jacob's מַצֵּבָה at Bethel) Gen 35:14 (E); elsewhere in worship of ׳י only P and related documents; once of vessels of holy table הַנָּ֑סֶךְ קְשׂוֺת Num 4:7 ; elsewhere in classifications Lev 23:37 ; Num 29:39 , usually offered with the עלה Exod 29:40 ; Lev 23:13 ; 23:18 ; Num 15:5 ; 15:7 ; 15:10 ; 15:24 ; 28:7 ; 28:14 ; 28:31 ; 29:18 ; 28:21 ; 28:24 ; 28:27 ; 28:30 ; Numbers 28:33; Numbers 28:37, especially הַתָּמִיד עוֺלַת 28:9-10 , 15 , 24 ; 29:6 , 11 , 16 , 19 , 22 , 25 , 28 , 31 , 34 , 38 ; הַבֹּקֶר מִנְחַת Exod 29:41 ; Num 28:8 ; but sometimes also with ( שׁלמים ) זבח 6:15 , 17 ; 15:15 , 10 ; usually + מִנְחָה ; elsewhere only 1Chr 29:21 ; 2Chr 29:35 ; Ezek 45:17 ; ׳וָנ מִנְחָה Joel 1:9 , 13 ; 2:14 . Offered to other gods 2Kin 16:13 , 15 ; Isa 57:6 ; Jer 7:18 ; 19:13 ; 32:29 ; 44:17-18 , 19 (twice in verse); 44:25 ; Ezek 20:28 ; Psa 16:4 . 2 molten images , Isa 41:29 ; 48:5 ; Jer 10:14 ; 51:17 . &#8212; Combinations are: נ ׳הִסִּיךְ נ, ׳נָסַךְ (see verb); נ ׳שָׁפַךְ Isa 57:6 .","rootNote":"or נֵסֶךְ ; from 5258 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 29 21","keyReferences":["1Chr 29 21","2Chr 29 35","2Kgs 16 13","2Kgs 16 15","Exod 29 40","Exod 29 41","Exod 30 9","Ezek 20 28"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":64,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 29 21","book":"1Chr","chapter":29,"verse":21,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/נִסְכֵּי/הֶ֑ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmpc/Sp3mp"},{"reference":"2Chr 29 35","book":"2Chr","chapter":29,"verse":35,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/בַ/נְּסָכִ֖ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Rd/Ncmpa"},{"reference":"2Kgs 16 13","book":"2Kgs","chapter":16,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"נִסְכּ֑/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"2Kgs 16 15","book":"2Kgs","chapter":16,"verse":15,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/נִסְכֵּי/הֶ֔ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmpc/Sp3mp"},{"reference":"Exod 29 40","book":"Exod","chapter":29,"verse":40,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/נֵ֕סֶךְ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"Exod 29 41","book":"Exod","chapter":29,"verse":41,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/כְ/נִסְכָּ/הּ֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/R/Ncmsc/Sp3fs"},{"reference":"Exod 30 9","book":"Exod","chapter":30,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/נֵ֕סֶךְ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"Ezek 20 28","book":"Ezek","chapter":20,"verse":28,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"נִסְכֵּי/הֶֽם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpc/Sp3mp"},{"referenc